  "name": "git2-rs",
  "description": "Safe and idiomatic Rust bindings to the libgit2 C library for comprehensive Git repository management and manipulation. The crate provides high-level abstractions for the Git object model, including commit graph traversal, diffing engines, and index management, while ensuring memory safety through Rust's ownership system. It supports advanced features such as custom smart transport registration, credential helpers, and thread-safe repository access.",
